/a></span>，黄埔 / 冬将军</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h3><span>我们中混进了<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">一个</span>几个叛徒（？</span></h3> <p><span style="color: #a6a4a4">只因为它们不是……好吧它们就是圆的</span><br /> <span style="color: #a6a4a4">等等，现在还有方的</span></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;石膏体的凹陷</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Surface&nbsp;of&nbsp;Plaster</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width: 800px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/lyricslinn-s-personnel-file/ball-bro.jpg" style="width: 800px" class="enlarge" alt="ball-bro.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width: 100%;"> <p>作者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/red-cactus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4697472&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="red cactus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4697472)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/red-cactus" >red cactus</a></span>，译者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ivi-jinn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4684395&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="Ivi-Jinn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4684395)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ivi-jinn" >Ivi-Jinn</a></span>，<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/surface-of-plaster">Surface of Plaster</a></p> </div> </div> <br /> <em>那双眼睛里突然有了光，因为酒精而浑浊的绿色里混进了一股澄清的东西。它们变得明亮了一些。</em></div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;极乐净土</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Elysium</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width: 800px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/lyricslinn-s-personnel-file/ball-fas.jpg" style="width: 800px" class="enlarge" alt="ball-fas.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width: 100%;"> <p>作者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/infas12" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3416873&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="Infas12" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3416873)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/infas12" >Infas12</a></span>，译者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1621343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="SunnyClockwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1621343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sunnyclockwork" >SunnyClockwork</a></span>，<a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/elysium">Elysium</a></p> </div> </div> <br /> <em>不过他没料到当今的社会比他想象的还要赛博朋克一点。</em><br /> <em>一只银色球形机器人在Silver身边出现，但不知出于何种原因，它似乎套着一身女仆装。</em></div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;我的终结即是新生</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;SCP-3997</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width: 800px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/lyricslinn-s-personnel-file/ball-3997.jpg" style="width: 800px" class="enlarge" alt="ball-3997.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width: 100%;"> <p>作者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3337265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="Tufto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3337265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tufto" >Tufto</a></span>，译者：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashausesall" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1546989&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="ashausesall" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1546989)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ashausesall" >ashausesall</a></span>，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3997">SCP-3997</a></p> </div> </div> <br /> <em>我们都想回到一切是温暖、简单的时候，满是夏阳和翠草的时光。我们每个人都想重新沐浴在光明之下。但我们都做了自己的选择，我们都许下了自己的誓言。我们每个人都会在黑暗中死去，别无他法。</em></div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;受关注个体大杂烩</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;混进了几个神性实体和GOI</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width: 800px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/lyricslinn-s-personnel-file/GOIs.jpg" style="width: 800px" class="enlarge" alt="GOIs.jpg" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width: 100%;"></div> </div> <br /> <span style="color: #a6a4a4">来自<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3290685&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="Rye Travis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3290685)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rye-travis" >Rye Travis</a></span>的点字！第一次尝试这个风格的排版，玩得好开心</span></div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p><span style="color: #a6a4a4">感谢您看到这里！</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <span style="color: #a6a4a4">大约是中分的第一个Calligraphy艺作页？以后还会继续练字哒;)</span></p> <p><span style="color: #a6a4a4"><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">这真的是手写的，不是打印或者PS的……</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <h3><span>未完待续</span></h3> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556250" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
