/local--files/icesilversandboxcn/IMG_4663.JPG" class="with-lb"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/icesilversandboxcn/IMG_4663.JPG" alt="" class="gallery-image-size-thumbnail" /></a></td> </tr> </table> </div> <div class="gallery-item thumbnail"> <table> <tr> <td><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/icesilversandboxcn/IMG_4664.JPG" class="with-lb"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/icesilversandboxcn/IMG_4664.JPG" alt="" class="gallery-image-size-thumbnail" /></a></td> </tr> </table> </div> <div class="gallery-item thumbnail"> <table> <tr> <td><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/icesilversandboxcn/IMG_4653.JPG" class="with-lb"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/icesilversandboxcn/IMG_4653.JPG" alt="" class="gallery-image-size-thumbnail" /></a></td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> <p><strong>图1:</strong> 基金会会标<br /> <strong>图2:</strong> 面包（人）<br /> <strong>图3:</strong> infas球<br /> <strong>图4:</strong> 13<br /> <strong>图5:</strong> 喵肉的海蛞蝓（长腿版）<br /> <strong>图6:</strong> 罩罩兔<br /> <strong>图7:</strong> 歌辞的银杏叶<br /> <strong>图8:</strong> 邮筒<br /> <strong>图9:</strong> 斯卡豹<br /> <strong>图10:</strong> Hello World<br /> <strong>图11:</strong> 面包的签名<br /> <strong>图12:</strong> 记忆删除（物理）</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <h1><span>魔法少女</span></h1> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">◢点我打开</a><a href="javascript:;">- 关闭</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <p>这里收录了我帮小伙伴们画的魔法少女们，充满了整活要素。<br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">另外，说来惭愧，我画这些的时候因为刚下procreate，所以没找到正片叠底在哪里，卑微的平涂人脱离了正片叠底就不会上阴影了。。。所以就全都只有底色orz</span></p> <p>如果接受的话就往下↓</p> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">+ 魔法少女Lake</a><a href="javascript:;">- 关闭</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <div style="display: inline-block; border:dashed 1px #999999; background:#ffffff; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"> <div style="display: inline-block; background:#ffffff; float:right; width:50%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/breaddddd-art-3/ms-lyrics.jpg" alt="ms-lyrics.jpg" class="image" /></div> <br /> <strong>魔法少女Lake</strong> <p>人设来源是<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556251" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span>，最初的要求是超大法杖和物理砸人攻击，其他内容是我整活的</p> <ul> <li>拿着三片巨大银杏叶组成的法杖，但其实是用来砸人的</li> <li>身上有很多银杏装饰叶，全是小型奇术炸弹</li> <li>甘道夫式加点</li> <li>也可以有原地种树的技能，然后可能会产出更多的炸弹？</li> </ul> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> <div> <div class="foldable-list-container"></div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">+ 魔法少女Rain</a><a href="javascript:;">- 关闭</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <div style="display: inline-block; border:dashed 1px #999999; background:#ffffff; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"> <div style="display: inline-block; background:#ffffff; float:right; width:50%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/breaddddd-art-3/ms-rhythm.jpg" alt="ms-rhythm.jpg" class="image" /></div> <br /> <strong>魔法少女Rain</strong> <p>人设来源是<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556251" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span>的OC Rhythm Linn，要求是投掷型武器和符咒，形象直接照搬之前的人设了，其他内容是我整活的</p> <ul> <li>使用符咒和短剑作战的音乐系</li> <li>符咒都是乐谱，可以通过指挥棒的动作发动</li> <li>短剑是自动追踪型投掷武器，音符咒剑那种的</li> <li>绝招是通过乐曲具现化一座城市的轮廓</li> </ul> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> <div> <div class="foldable-list-container"></div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">+ 魔法少女Microbiotics</a><a href="javascript:;">- 关闭</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <div style="display: inline-block; border:dashed 1px #999999; background:#ffffff; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"> <div style="display: inline-block; background:#ffffff; float:right; width:50%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/breaddddd-art-3/ms-phage.jpg" alt="ms-phage.jpg" class="image" /></div> <br /> <strong>魔法少女Microbiotics</strong> <p>人设来源是<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-phage" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2950095&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556251" alt="Agent Phage" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2950095)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-phage" >Agent Phage</a></span>，要求是镰刀和手部盾牌。考虑到phage本人的爱好（指噬魂师、烟草、异度侵入），进行了一波整活</p> <ul> <li>主武器是左手上的手表，启动后会形成一个小型圆盾，时针和分针分离之后会形成巨大的镰刀</li> <li>毕竟是时间系武器，打出攻击后会残留一段时间的dot伤害，也可以短暂时停</li> <li>整体都是烟草配色</li> <li>是个名侦探，经常活跃在死人的第一线，如果有魔法少女不幸战死了可以去找这位推理</li> </ul> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> <div> <div class="foldable-list-container"></div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">+ 魔法少女Dawn</a><a href="javascript:;">- 关闭</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <div style="display: inline-block; border:dashed 1px #999999; background:#ffffff; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"> <div style="display: inline-block; background:#ffffff; float:right; width:50%; padding:1px 15px; margin: 10px 10px 10px 40px"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/breaddddd-art-3/ms-dawn.jpg" alt="ms-dawn.jpg" class="image" /></div> <br /> <strong>魔法少女Dawn</strong> <p>人设来源是<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-phage" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2950095&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556251" alt="Agent Phage" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2950095)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-phage" >Agent Phage</a></span>的OC 晨曦.aic。好像完全没提要求所以我全面整活！</p> <ul> <li>通过青色玉石组成的腰饰和耳机收发信息</li> <li>能力和文字有关，类似言灵，可以将字符表达的意思变成某种能量打出去</li> <li>由于是AIC所以可以以全息投影的方式出战，可能会稍微影响一点能量传输</li> </ul> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> </div> </div> <div> <div class="foldable-list-container"></div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="colmod-block"> <ul> <li class="folded"> <ul> <li style="list-style: none">_</li> </ul> <div class="colmod-link-top"> <div class="foldable-list-container"><a href="javascript:;">+ 魔法少女Saw</a><a href="javascript:;">- 关闭</a></div> </div> <div class="colmod-content"> <div style="display: inline-block; border:dashed 1px #999999; background:#ffffff; float:center; width:84%; padding:1px 15px; m