					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div class="image-container aligncenter"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd100/%E6%8B%BC%E5%AD%97%E9%80%8F%E6%98%8E.png" alt="%E6%8B%BC%E5%AD%97%E9%80%8F%E6%98%8E.png" class="image" /></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>这里是面包菌的艺作页人设部分。</span></h1> <h1><span>看logo请去<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/breaddddd-art-2">这里</a>，杂项请去<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/breaddddd-art-3">这里</a>。</span></h1> </div> <hr /> <p><strong>观前提示：</strong></p> <ul> <li>以下内容存在大量娘化，对项目的个人理解以及与原人设不符合的地方。</li> <li>基本只涉及参与中分的成员。</li> <li>对于只出现过一次的成员，即使画面上的角色不是本人的个人人设，也会标出本人的wiki号。</li> <li>120之后的小人还没画好，画好了会贴上来。<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">咕咕咕</span></li> <li>上色方式是彩铅+纸胶带。如果你对哪张画里的胶带特别感兴趣可以来问我，我应该能找出是哪卷……不过有的可能已经绝版了就是。</li> <li>图很多很多，用流量的小伙伴请现在立刻马上关闭这个页面！</li> </ul> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">◢1-10</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">关闭</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="gallery-box" id="gallery-box-108292"> <div class="gallery-item thumbnail"> <table> <tr> <td><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd3/img052.jpg" class="with-lb"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd3/img052.jpg" alt="" class="gallery-image-size-thumbnail" /></a></td> </tr> </table> </div> <div class="gallery-item thumbnail"> <table> <tr> <td><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd100/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%BA-01.png" class="with-lb"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd100/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%BA-01.png" alt="" class="gallery-image-size-thumbnail" /></a></td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> <p><strong>No.1</strong></p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/hannah-s-personnel-file">Hannah</a>/<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hannah-ai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3082326&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556252" alt="Hannah_AI" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3082326)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hannah-ai" >Hannah_AI</a></span></li> <li>2018.2.3</li> <li>涉及的内容：<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-601">SCP-CN-601</a>“百日█孩”，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-521">SCP-CN-521</a>“玫瑰与阿司匹林”，<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-091">SCP-CN-091</a>“<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">留君醉</span>盼君归”</li> </ul> <hr /> <div class="gallery-box" id="gallery-box-553487"> <div class="gallery-item thumbnail"> <table> <tr> <td><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd3/img003.jpg" class="with-lb"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd3/img003.jpg" alt="" class="gallery-image-size-thumbnail" /></a></td> </tr> </table> </div> <div class="gallery-item thumbnail"> <table> <tr> <td><a href="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd100/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%BA-02.png" class="with-lb"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd100/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%BA-02.png" alt="" class="gallery-image-size-thumbnail" /></a></td> </tr> </table> </div> </div> <p><strong>No.2</strong></p> <ul> <li>See/戏/<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drsee" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2928788&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556252" alt="DrSee" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2928788)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drsee" >DrSee</a></span></li> <li>2018.2.6</li> <li>涉及的内容：<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-078">SCP-CN-078</a>“孤灯”</li> </ul> <hr /> <div class="gallery-box