rintuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aplous" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6236003&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556259" alt="aplous" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6236003)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aplous" >aplous</a></span>合著</p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span>故事（这人居然还会写故事？？）</span></h4> </div> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-size:180%;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-story-of-my-life">负重前行</a></span></strong></p> <p style="text-align: center;">肩负起自己的死地。</p> <p style="text-align: center;">本文为<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1494">SCP-CN-1494</a>的外围</p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h4><span>翻译页面</span></h4> </div> <hr /> <div class="blbf-main"> <div class="blbf-unique-name-9 blbf-{$color-family}"> <div class="anom-bar-container item-5856 clear-3 机密 Robertson-Jackal keneq 警告 {$american} lang-cn"> <div class="anom-bar"> <div class="top-box"> <div class="top-left-box"><span class="item"><span class="lang-cn">项目编号：</span><span class="lang-tr">項目編號：</span></span><span class="number">5856</span></div> <div class="top-center-box"> <div class="bar-one"></div> <div class="bar-two"></div> <div class="bar-three"></div> <div class="bar-four"></div> <div class="bar-five"></div> <div class="bar-six"></div> </div> <div class="top-right-box"> <div class="level"><span class="lang-cn">等级</span><span class="lang-tr">等級</span>3</div> <div class="clearance"></div> </div> </div> <div class="bottom-box"> <div class="text-part"> <div class="main-class"> <div class="contain-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">收容等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">收容等級：</span></div> <div class="class-text">机密</div> </div> <div class="second-class"> <div class="class-category"><span class="lang-cn">次要等级：</span><span class="lang-tr">次要等級：</span></div> <div