					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="logo"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/estrellayoshte/logo.png" alt="logo.png" class="image" /></div> <div class="anchor"> <div class="sidebox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">最新页面：</span></span></h3> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges">基金会炫酷成就徽章</a> [+43]</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">我推荐的页面：</span></span></h3> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne">我的艺桌页</a> - 我设计的所有标志都在这里。</p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5552">SCP-5552</a> - 我最爱的SCP之一。</p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/artpage-fartpage">lynch的艺作屁作</a> - 一个很酷很有趣的3D艺作页！</p> <p><a class="newpage" href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/theme:flopstyle">Flopstyle CSS</a> - 非常floppy。</p> </div> </div> <div class="header-container"> <div class="text-item"> <p><span style="font-size:90%;"><span style="color: grey"><strong>合格？</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:220%;"><strong>完全</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="text-item"> <p><span style="font-size:90%;"><span style="color: grey"><strong>项目等级：</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style="font-size:220%;"><strong>RADICAL</strong></span></p> </div> <div class="grid-item"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/estrellayoshte/u.png" style="width:300px;" alt="u.png" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>一张所谓的自画像。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="textbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">我的自传：</span></span></h2> <p>lol不要，那看起来好累<br /> 当然好像是挺酷挺有趣的<br /> 然而我懒到完全不想写它<br /> 但是你也可以假装我写了</p> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <div id="wiki-tabview-b11abc47d6389a586b2b6060af033dda" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>关于我，认真的</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>我的文章</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p>你好，我是<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span>，又名<strong>SYwaves</strong>，又名“那做了一大堆标志的人”，又名“主题多得数不过来的人”，而这是我的“作者”页。</p> <p>从职业上看我可能更多是一个艺术家，极罕见的情况下会出现在wiki之外。</p> <p>其他用户对我的评价：</p> <div class="blockquote"> <p>Estrella除了主题之外你还有3篇文章吗？<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>sywaves会做很好的标志。sywaves会做很好的图像和符号。sywaves会做很好的主题。sywaves会做很好的艺术。<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>你真的有写过什么吗，Estrella？<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" >Ralliston</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>你给这个网站做的标志和主题已经足以让你享有家喻户晓的名声了<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" >Lt Flops</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>我不造你是做了个主题还是啥的，但它很好很强大<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5588260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="JakdragonX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5588260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" >JakdragonX</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>德国<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3207203&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="JackalRelated" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3207203)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jackalrelated" >JackalRelated</a></span></p> </div> <div class="blockquote"> <p>真好！dune说titties<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-dune" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6682213&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="J Dune" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6682213)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/j-dune" >J Dune</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="infobox"> <p style="text-align: center;"><tt><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span></strong></tt></p> <p style="text-align: center;">共11篇</p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>故事</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/iconic-im-on-it">Iconic, I'm on it</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoficonic-im-on-it 20"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>20</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoficonic-im-on-it {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/flos">flos</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofflos 44"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>44</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofflos {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/icon-documents">Regular documents from the Iconography Division</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoficon-documents 30"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>30</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoficon-documents {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>其他</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne">desk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofdesk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne 117"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>117</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofdesk-of-junior-designer-s-yvonne {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/theme:simple-yonder">Simple Yonder Theme</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoftheme:simple-yonder 20"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>20</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoftheme:simple-yonder �35525�"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/theme:technoblast">theme:technoblast</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoftheme:technoblast 23"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>23</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoftheme:technoblast �35527�"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/theme:paperstack">theme:paperstack</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoftheme:paperstack 30"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>30</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoftheme:paperstack �35529�"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/theme:xmas">theme:xmas</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoftheme:xmas 38"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>38</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoftheme:xmas �35531�"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/estrellayoshte">estrellayoshte</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofestrellayoshte 46"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>46</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofestrellayoshte {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dark-achievement-badges">dark-achievement-badges</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofdark-achievement-badges 43"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>43</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofdark-achievement-badges {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/theme:penumbra">theme:penumbra</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoftheme:penumbra 23"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>23</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoftheme:penumbra �35533�"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <h2><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">我有贡献的其他页面：</span></span></h2> <div class="hexacontainer" style="margin-top: -0rem;"> <div class="hexaheader"> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/aiad-homescreen">AIAD 主頁面</a></span></h2> </div> </div> <div class="hexabody"> <p>和<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span>合作，彻底翻新了视觉美学，让它更具流线型。导致了<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/theme:technoblast">科技爆破版式</a>的创作。</p> </div> <div class="hexacontainer" style="margin-top: -0rem;"> <div class="hexaheader"> <h2><span><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scpdeclassified">解密SCP中心页</a></span></h2> </div> </div> <div class="hexabody"> <blockquote> <p>在过去的六个月里，EstrellaYoshte在解密SCP中心页完成的工作比其他任何人都多。我的工作还没被抢的唯一原因就是人家在忙着做主题。</p> </blockquote> <p>– <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226742&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="Elunerazim" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226742)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" >Elunerazim</a></span>，解密SCP的版主，他的工作可能要被抢了。</p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <h2><span><span style="text-decoration: underline;">成就徽章：</span></span></h2> <div style="text-align: center;"><span class="tooltip"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dark-achievement-badges"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/component%3Asybadge/tsf.png" style="background: linear-gradient(45deg, #21252E,#2F333C); padding: .66rem .7rem .4rem .5rem; border-radius: .6rem 2.5rem .6rem .6rem; margin: .3rem; border: solid 4px var(--borderColor);" width="64px" alt="tsf.png" class="image" /></a><span class="tooltiptext"><span class="tsf"> </span></span></span></div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4113182&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608556263" alt="Esperanza_Cai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4113182)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/esperanza-cai" >Esperanza_Cai</a></span></p> 
